<p>[5] T. Bray, Ed., "The JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) data interchange format," RFC 8259, IETF, Dec. 2017. [Online]. Available: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8259</p>
<p>[6] R. Fielding and J. Reschke, Eds., "Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP/1.1): Semantics and content," RFC 7231, IETF, Jun. 2014. [Online]. Available: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7231</p>
