<p>[8] M. Jones, J. Bradley, and N. Sakimura, "JSON Web Token (JWT)," RFC 7519, IETF, May 2015. [Online]. Available: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7519</p>
<p>[9] C. Richardson, <em>Microservices Patterns: With Examples in Java</em>. Shelter Island, NY, USA: Manning Publications, 2019.</p>
